


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_1375eec9:


    "两个人手持铁锹站在一起看着屋顶。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4b7d42cf:



    voice "2SA_0249"
    sachiko "「辛苦了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_ccd463e1:



    voice "2MI_0400"
    miyako "「辛苦你啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_cb28a07f:


    "总之雪已经扫完了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_98b073da:


    "虽说是除雪，但也并非是那么严格意义上的除雪，只是为了防止融化的雪渗透下来而将雪转移到排水沟附近而已。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_f7719f8b:


    "这里也并非什么暴雪地区，所以雪量也是两个女性就可以解决的水平。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_d365687b:



    voice "2SA_0250"
    sachiko "「你，长成这样还挺有力气的嘛。这就是年轻吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_60102e6c:


    "说着，祥子活动了下肩膀然后从口袋里拿出烟。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_f5b3474f:



    voice "2MI_0401"
    miyako "「不，我觉得是那个的原因」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_069ab15e:


    "斩钉截铁。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4502b50b:



    voice "2SA_0251"
    sachiko "「啊——啊——啊——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_ee313d6e:



    voice "2MI_0402"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_98fe2a6f:



    voice "2SA_0252"
    sachiko "「早知道当初就算只有外表也好，选个年轻的原型就好了。那样我就不会当什么宿管而是和你们一样穿上制服了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_ee3e7462:


    "结果祥子把烟收了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_eb5a7dc2:



    voice "2MI_0403"
    miyako "「随时都可以穿哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_ae2e37f5:



    voice "2SA_0253"
    sachiko "「那也太那啥了。那就变成cosplay了。不知道会被伦这样的说些什么」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_75a83bc9:


    "能想象到她坏笑的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a4bfc06c:



    voice "2MI_0404"
    miyako "「你的原型是什么人的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b0009772:


    "天使的形体原本是暧昧不明的不定形。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_0747a430:


    "所以在降临到地上的时候，天使不得不借用某人的身姿。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_ca98883b:


    "她们将其称为原型。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_fe7934eb:



    voice "2SA_0254"
    sachiko "「在超市的试吃柜台上卖草莓的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_8d37bb4c:



    voice "2MI_0405"
    miyako "「嗯？你和那位有什么深交吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_7eed23ff:



    voice "2SA_0255"
    sachiko "「完全没有。只是偶然看到了而已，其他一无所知哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_0770229b:



    voice "2SA_0256"
    sachiko "「现在想一想我那时毫无计划非常随意……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_8252c48e:


    "祥子背靠在栏杆上叹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4d142651:



    voice "2MI_0406"
    miyako "「我觉得她是一位很美的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_263bad5e:


    "圣夜子一边看着她抬头望天的侧脸一边告诉她。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_ad325a35:



    voice "2SA_0257"
    sachiko "「还好吧，我很喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_dbb13884:



    voice "2MI_0407"
    miyako "「我也很喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_50c22e25:



    voice "2SA_0258"
    sachiko "「噢，噢。谢了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4a877f03:


    "山风吹拂，摇动常青树的枝条。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_bdcf9af1:



    voice "2SA_0259"
    sachiko "「那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_256f7066:



    voice "2MI_0408"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4d82b01c:



    voice "2SA_0260"
    sachiko "「那你的原型呢？是和你有什么关系的人吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a6e47cd9:



    voice "2MI_0409"
    miyako "「不。和你差不多。是连名字都不知道的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_675f78bf:



    voice "2SA_0261"
    sachiko "「……是这样吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_49f5409b:



    voice "2MI_0410"
    miyako "「是的。我是在几年前看到她的。在来到这个镇子之前，很远的城市里。而且还是只擦身而过见了一次」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_f66c2e7b:



    voice "2SA_0262"
    sachiko "「是吗……我们两个还真是随便」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_79de9f2a:



    voice "2MI_0411"
    miyako "「但是，她是我记忆中最漂亮的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_bce9991d:


    "那还真是。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_72e51149:



    voice "2SA_0263"
    sachiko "「……呵呵」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_c95ae46f:



    voice "2MI_0412"
    miyako "「是你说的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_0069ca7c:



    voice "2SA_0264"
    sachiko "「啊？我说了啥来着？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_5a7ebf6a:



    voice "2MI_0413"
    miyako "「是的，在我被邀请的时候。说自己很看重外表所以让我以美人的姿态降临」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_c09c12e7:



    voice "2SA_0265"
    sachiko "「啊……我可能是这么说过」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_78b7b87e:



    voice "2MI_0414"
    miyako "「是对我这么说了。所以我才选了这位」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_53909066:



    voice "2SA_0266"
    sachiko "「那真是太好了。幸亏不是三叶虫降临下来」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4e99eb0c:


    "祥子拨了下鬓角，开了个玩笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b739ca4f:



    voice "2MI_0415"
    miyako "「盯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_f868164b:



    voice "2SA_0267"
    sachiko "「咋，咋了？太近了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_efa1b912:


    "圣夜子一边逼近一边将脸凑到祥子面前。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_186ac6ba:



    voice "2MI_0416"
    miyako "「你觉得我看起来怎么样呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_84c6fe00:



    voice "2SA_0268"
    sachiko "「嗯，嗯嗯……很可爱哦，似乎会很受欢迎」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_c39fe450:



    voice "2MI_0417"
    miyako "「不是问这个，是问你的看法，你喜欢吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_533410bf:



    voice "2SA_0269"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_800ccc47:



    voice "2SA_0270"
    sachiko "「……还好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_3ab7c68e:



    voice "2MI_0418"
    miyako "「唉……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_45b7c0db:


    "叹了口气之后，圣夜子走开了，面对栅栏。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_bc878ba8:



    voice "2MI_0419"
    miyako "「那我也觉得这幅姿态还好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_39bf54f6:



    voice "2SA_0271"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_1d5addc5:


    "隔着栅栏，圣夜子抬头望向天空。这次祥子盯起了她的侧脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_eb316ca2:



    voice "2SA_0272"
    sachiko "「……呼」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_ea5056a1:


    "不知为何笑了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_7d45dc7c:



    voice "2MI_0420"
    miyako "「怎么了——啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_943aeaa2:


    "转过头去的一瞬间，一个白块在她的脸上砸开了花。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_8f710770:



    voice "2SA_0273"
    sachiko "「第一次被雪球砸感觉如何？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_e4cf4e3f:


    "她刚才似乎是在收集残留在栅栏网上的雪。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_e6b64514:



    voice "2SA_0274"
    sachiko "「冷？还是感觉不错？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_05bb2c8a:


    "祥子带着一脸恶作剧的表情甩掉手上的雪。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_081f60e8:



    voice "2MI_0421"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4d6e7864:



    voice "2SA_0275"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈，还不知道怎么一回事的表情——呀啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_0bafcc93:


    "圣夜子扫起残留在栅栏基台上的雪。细雪落在了祥子身上。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_38956274:



    voice "2MI_0422"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4486e81a:


    "莞尔一笑。然后……"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_9855a76b:


    "二人突然向后跳去，跑向两处雪堆。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_44ef7b3d:


    "突然爆发的雪仗。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_202ae06a:


    "从各自的雪堆上搜集雪然后丢出去，搜集雪然后丢出去。哎呀哎呀，明明是好不容易扫到一起的。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_03f32d9e:


    "不久之前的祥子还在告诫圣夜子，不要任凭感觉而是要去习惯有身体。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_3537f601:


    "——虽然主要是在提醒她，人是会感冒的所以要小心。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_83306d34:


    "而现在，两个原天使的头发上衣服上都沾满了雪，一边咯咯地笑着一边享受着雪的寒冷。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_01ab4af2:



    voice "2MI_0423"
    miyako "「呀————！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_dd6bed7b:


    "已经用光了自己这边的雪的圣夜子双手抓住残弹，呐喊道。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_5664c032:



    voice "2MI_0424"
    miyako "「哇哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_490d7415:


    "但是，圣夜子在敌阵当前被冻结的地面滑倒，失去了身体平衡。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_3fb922e1:



    voice "2SA_0276"
    sachiko "「啊……哟呵！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_209b4a14:


    "虽然祥子想伸手去帮快要一屁股坐到地上的圣夜子，但是冻结的地面并没有能够支撑两个人的摩擦力。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_feeeb447:


    miyako_sachiko "「哇啊啊啊啊！？」\n「呜哇哇哇哇！？」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b3135cda:


    "祥子叠在圣夜子上面。两个人四目相对。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_5fdebd8c:



    voice "2MI_0426"
    miyako "「与那个时候上下相反呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_c9f20e10:



    voice "2SA_0278"
    sachiko "「那个时候？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_831fcd9f:



    voice "2MI_0427"
    miyako "「圣诞节……那个时候是降临下来的我在上面」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a7c556ce:



    voice "2SA_0279"
    sachiko "「不是降临，是掉下来」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_95d6907f:



    voice "2MI_0428"
    miyako "「啊哈哈。抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_49018c76:



    voice "2SA_0280"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_e31185fd:



    voice "2MI_0429"
    miyako "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a4a7bd03:



    voice "2SA_0281"
    sachiko "「围巾，很适合你」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_c7f37b82:



    voice "2MI_0430"
    miyako "「谢谢你们」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_7c037ff6:



    voice "2SA_0282"
    sachiko "「送给你了，戴在你身上最好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4e22935e:



    voice "2MI_0431"
    miyako "「没关系吗？这不是对你来说很珍贵的东西吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_2e585de2:



    voice "2SA_0283"
    sachiko "「所以，好好爱惜它」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_7528100d:



    voice "2MI_0432"
    miyako "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_e6ffa859:



    voice "2SA_0284"
    sachiko "「……刚才是骗你的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_16d5aa8f:



    voice "2MI_0433"
    miyako "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_9441beef:



    voice "2SA_0285"
    sachiko "「说你的长相只是还好……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4fccb536:



    voice "2MI_0434"
    miyako "「啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_7feea11f:



    voice "2SA_0286"
    sachiko "「我很喜欢你的长相……太棒了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_4e3dea44:



    voice "2MI_0435"
    miyako "「太好了。我很高兴」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_1db5b459:



    voice "2SA_0287"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_71b825c1:



    voice "2MI_0436"
    miyako "「咦，那个……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_e1aadc37:


    "祥子把脸凑了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_72d4798f:


    "两个人已经近到了呼吸都交错在一起的程度上。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_37576318:



    voice "2MI_0437"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_d06f4fe5:


    "但是，不管挨得多近，圣夜子都没有挪开视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_23797891:


    "她的眼神里既没有恐惧也没有害羞，只是注视着面前的祥子，接受了她。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_9e112141:



    voice "2SA_0288"
    sachiko "「……闭上眼睛」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_3248b9c9:


    "——逃走了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_c20882a6:



    voice "2MI_0438"
    miyako "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_94b72287:


    "圣夜子听话地闭上了眼睛。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_d6dfc0ce:



    voice "2MI_0439"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_dd208ba3:


    "放松下来的嘴唇一边微微颤抖着，一边等待着被触碰。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_cde02d69:



    voice "2SA_0289"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_fb2383a9:


    "祥子再次把嘴唇凑了过来——"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_6a90b842:



    voice "2SA_0290"
    sachiko "「……！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_017d82c2:


    "嘴唇还差一点就碰到了。祥子好像是被弹开了一样地离开了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_c5294b47:


    "张开的双瞳。颤抖的嘴唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_ee3ef335:



    voice "2SA_0291"
    sachiko "「乃——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_292fee8e:


    "一阵风吹走了话语。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_8f840f72:



    voice "2MI_0440"
    miyako "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_1e8bbf26:


    "察觉到气氛发生变化的圣夜子张开了眼睛。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_ee6742c7:


    "祥子的双瞳失去了刚才的温热，浮现出了阴霾，动摇不已。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_5ab628ea:



    voice "2SA_0292"
    sachiko "「……抱歉」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_a_84e93f45:



    voice "2MI_0441"
    miyako "「……祥子？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_cab697fb:



    voice "2HI_0553"
    hina "「我回来了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_1685826f:


    miyako_sachiko "「！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_b08318c6:



    voice "2HI_0554"
    hina "「雪扫好了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_65c53e7b:


    "是阳菜。声音从下面传了上来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_cc54a6d8:



    voice "2RI_0570"
    rin "「声音好大。一般人会直接向屋顶上喊话吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_bfdfef80:



    voice "2FU_0484"
    fumi "「啊哈哈。旁边宿舍都有回音了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_31fdd047:



    voice "2HI_0555"
    hina "「没人回应，是不是已经回房间了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_a59ab7cb:


    "三个人拿着咔沙作响的塑料袋来到玄关。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_10eb63a5:


    "而屋顶上的两个人身体叠在一起，在尴尬的气氛中听到了刚刚那段对话。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_4e8290ac:



    voice "2SA_0294"
    sachiko "「阳菜亲她们回来了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_12d34bb5:



    voice "2MI_0443"
    miyako "「说的是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_7299fe4f:


    "祥子胆胆怯怯地起了身。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_ca6ec0ab:


    "圣夜子也一起站了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_6b5f3297:



    voice "2MI_0444"
    miyako "「那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_37ea55d7:



    voice "2SA_0295"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈，吓了一跳？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_8cc3ff81:


    "祥子的笑声盖过了圣夜子的话音。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_fbdf503b:



    voice "2MI_0445"
    miyako "「……有点」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_11_b_34cb3ce5:



